# Keep the build context to source: never local dependencies, builds, test output or secrets.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-e2e
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
.git
.github
.local
backups
docs
# Environment files hold secrets; containers get configuration from the orchestrator.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
# Tests and fixtures do not belong in runtime images.
apps/api/tests
apps/web/tests
apps/web/e2e
apps/desktop-agent
